---
import Base from "../../../layouts/Base.astro";

const description = "Discourse Network by CWL is an add-on plugin for DiscussionBridge that coordinates members publishing their own selected content to other Discourse forums and to websites and publishing platforms.";
const discussionUrl = "https://forum.codeworkslabs.dev/t/discourse-network-by-cwl-in-process-seeking-inputs/17";
---

<Base title="Discourse Network by CWL — CodeWorksLabs" {description}>
  <section class="product-hero">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow"><span></span> Discourse Network by CWL</p>
      <h1>Discourse<br /><em>Network</em></h1>
      <p class="lede">{description}</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="button button-primary" href={discussionUrl}>Discuss Network and share your use case <span>↗</span></a>
        <a class="button button-secondary" href="/products/discussionbridge/">About DiscussionBridge</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <aside class="release-panel">
      <p>Product status</p><strong>In process - Seeking Inputs</strong><span>DiscussionBridge add-on plugin</span>
      <dl><div><dt>Requires</dt><dd>DiscussionBridge</dd></div><div><dt>Federation</dt><dd>Not required</dd></div><div><dt>Maker</dt><dd>CodeWorksLabs</dd></div></dl>
    </aside>
  </section>
  <section class="section install-band">
    <div><p class="eyebrow"><span></span> Autonomous forums</p><h2>Join a Network.<br /><em>Operate your own.</em></h2></div>
    <div>
      <p>Member forums remain autonomous, retaining control over their content and participation. A forum can join another Network while operating its own—for example, a State forum joining a National Network while running its own Network for County and District forums.</p>
      <p>Network requires DiscussionBridge and works without Discourse Federation. Member participation does not transfer ownership of content or create publication permission by itself.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/products/discourse-federation/">Explore Discourse Federation →</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section install-band">
    <div><p class="eyebrow"><span></span> Help shape it</p><h2>Your organization.<br /><em>Your use cases.</em></h2></div>
    <div>
      <p>Membership, onboarding and the operation of connected Networks are being defined while retaining each forum’s publication control.</p>
      <p>Tell us how your forums are organized, which content each forum would select for publication and where that content needs to appear.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href={discussionUrl}>Follow plans, contribute examples and suggest improvements →</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="limitations"><strong>In process - Seeking Inputs</strong><p>Release coverage and installation details remain to be established. Follow the forum discussion for updates and share the workflows your community needs.</p></section>
</Base>
